.TH CRUNCH_EPOLL_WAIT_OLD 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_epoll_wait_old \- invokes obsolete epoll_wait_old syscall slot 215, unimplemented on linux x86-64
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/legacy_syscalls.h>
.B int crunch_epoll_wait_old(int epoll, void* events, int maximum, int timeout);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes obsolete epoll_wait_old syscall slot 215, unimplemented on Linux x86-64. Seccomp or other policy may instead return a different error.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR epoll_wait_old (2)
